<title>JAPAN: Suruga to issue three bln yen Euroyen CB.</title>
<headline>Suruga to issue three bln yen Euroyen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Suruga Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nikko Bank (Switzerland)</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible  ISSUE NO	   AMT   3 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON			  ISSU PRICE	 MATURITY 19.Dec.00</p>
<p> CONV PRICE		    CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 06.Jan.97	 CONV TO 11.Dec.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 19.Dec.96    INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 03.Dec.96   SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI		 LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on December 3.</p>
